{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"64ecfece","type":"group","x":20,"y":1720,"width":2020,"height":1240,"color":"#3a2a1a","label":"✅ Post-Call Processing"},
		{"id":"0004f96b","type":"group","x":-40,"y":-120,"width":1560,"height":500,"color":"#16213e","label":"🖥️ UI/API Server (ui_server.py :8081)"},
		{"id":"06c24024","type":"group","x":20,"y":470,"width":1680,"height":450,"color":"#0f3460","label":"☁️ LiveKit Cloud"},
		{"id":"ce03869b","type":"group","x":20,"y":1040,"width":1560,"height":310,"color":"#1a3a2e","label":"🤖 Voice Agent Worker (agent.py)"},
		{"id":"5b635a30","type":"group","x":-40,"y":-340,"width":1560,"height":140,"color":"#1a1a2e","label":"🌐 External Systems"},
		{"id":"5efc16f2","type":"text","text":"n8n / Webhook\n(automation workflow)","fontSize":13,"x":290,"y":-300,"width":220,"height":70,"color":"#4ecdc4"},
		{"id":"367a9fe1","type":"text","text":"Test Console\n(manual dispatch)","fontSize":13,"x":590,"y":-300,"width":220,"height":70,"color":"#4ecdc4"},
		{"id":"26838aa3","type":"text","text":"MantraAssist CRM\n(outbound trigger)","fontSize":13,"x":-10,"y":-300,"width":220,"height":70,"color":"#4ecdc4"},
		{"id":"1badd8ef","type":"text","text":"POST /v1/webhooks/telephony\nEntry point for ALL outbound calls\nPayload: {call_id, client_phone,\n trunk_id, prompt, model, voice, lead_id}","fontSize":12,"x":90,"y":-85,"width":370,"height":145,"color":"#45b7d1"},
		{"id":"c1e983a8","type":"text","text":"📞 Step 1: Parse Payload\ncall_id, client_phone,\ntrunk_id, prompt, model, voice\n(no Redis dedup lock —\nevery request processed immediately)","fontSize":11,"x":40,"y":90,"width":220,"height":190,"color":"#a8e6cf"},
		{"id":"7c2f3c34","type":"text","text":"📞 Step 2: Resolve Phone\nNormalize to E.164\nclient_phone + country_code\n→ +919876543210","fontSize":11,"x":280,"y":100,"width":220,"height":180,"color":"#a8e6cf"},
		{"id":"673bdd21","type":"text","text":"📦 Sample Payload:\n{\n  call_id: 12345,\n  client_phone: +919876543210,\n  client_country_code: 91,\n  trunk_id: ST_trunk_abc,\n  prompt: custom instructions,\n  model: deepseek,\n  voice: arushi,\n  client_name: Ravi,\n  lead_id: lead_678 }","fontSize":11,"x":580,"y":-110,"width":680,"height":280,"color":"#45b7d1"},
		{"id":"1a918e3d","type":"text","text":"⏳ Wait for Remote Participant\nwhile not remote_participants:\n  sleep(0.5)\n  if elapsed > 60s:\n    force_disconnect()\n    → No Answer (hangup)","fontSize":11,"x":500,"y":1075,"width":240,"height":255,"color":"#b5e7a0"},
		{"id":"caf83edc","type":"text","text":"🛡️ 3 Background Monitors:\n\n1. Inactivity Monitor\n   15s → ask \"still there?\"\n   30s → force disconnect\n\n2. Farewell Safety Net\n   Check last msg every 3s\n   Detects goodbye w/o end_call\n   Force disconnects\n\n3. Call Limiter\n   t+150s → farewell prompt\n   t+180s → HARD DISCONNECT","fontSize":11,"x":1300,"y":1075,"width":360,"height":385,"color":"#ffd93d"},
		{"id":"794ac5d2","type":"text","text":"📋 entrypoint() runs\n1. ctx.connect() → joins room\n2. Parse metadata from ctx.job\n3. Resolve KB context if inbound\n4. Build initial_instructions\n   (prompt + context fields + IVR)\n5. Select LLM/TTS/STT:\n   model=gpt-4o-mini|deepseek|gemini\n   voice=arushi|gemma|vikas|...\n   stt=deepgram nova-3 (hi)\n   tts=cartesia sonic-3\n6. Create Agent with tools:\n   • end_call()\n   • search_knowledge_base()\n   • transfer_to_human()","fontSize":11,"x":20,"y":1075,"width":390,"height":445,"color":"#b5e7a0"},
		{"id":"b51a4311","type":"text","text":"🎙️ CONVERSATION LOOP\nSTT (Deepgram Nova-3)\n  user speech → text\n  Hindi model for Hinglish\n      ↓\nLLM (GPT/DeepSeek/Gemini)\n  text → response text\n  Tools: KB search, availability, end_call\n      ↓\nTTS (LiveKit native sonic-3)\n  response text → speech\n  Speed=1.0, 13 voices\n      ↓\nAgent speaks to room\n  Customer hears & responds\n      ↻ loop","fontSize":11,"x":870,"y":1050,"width":390,"height":410,"color":"#86c7f0"},
		{"id":"51e61531","type":"text","text":"🔚 Call Ends Via:\n• end_call() tool → 3s delay\n• Remote hangup event\n• Inactivity (10s)\n• Safety net triggered\n• Hard limiter (180s)\n\n→ All paths enter finally block\n→ asyncio.shield(finalize())","fontSize":11,"x":100,"y":1755,"width":340,"height":235,"color":"#f0d9b5"},
		{"id":"30d93f96","type":"text","text":"1️⃣ Cancel Background Tasks\nlimiter_task, inactivity_task,\nsafety_net_task → cancel()","fontSize":11,"x":470,"y":1740,"width":290,"height":95,"color":"#f0d9b5"},
		{"id":"83047a1c","type":"text","text":"2️⃣ Capture History Snapshot\nlist(session.history.messages())\nPreserves transcript before\nsession cleanup","fontSize":11,"x":780,"y":1740,"width":320,"height":130,"color":"#f0d9b5"},
		{"id":"245fec51","type":"text","text":"🔌 Step 3: Resolve Trunk\npayload.trunk_id → env.SIP_TRUNK_ID\nDetect provider via\n_get_provider_from_trunk()\n→ twilio / plivo / zadarma","fontSize":11,"x":580,"y":190,"width":280,"height":170,"color":"#a8e6cf"},
		{"id":"2aa12713","type":"text","text":"3️⃣ Determine Call Status\nuser_joined=False, ring_time ≥30s\n  → No Answer\nuser_joined=False, 3s≤ring<30s\n  → Busy\nuser_joined=False, ring<3s\n  → Failed\nNo user messages (outbound only)\n  → No Answer\nUser spoke (or inbound call)\n  → Completed","fontSize":11,"x":1130,"y":1715,"width":380,"height":240,"color":"#f0d9b5"},
		{"id":"fd348bfc","type":"text","text":"4️⃣ Recording → S3\nOnly if status=Completed\nstop_recording()-> PCM frames\n  mix all tracks (numpy)\n  trim leading silence (pydub)\n  export 128k MP3\n  upload_to_s3(recordings/{id}.mp3)\n    → S3 bucket (public-read)\n    → returns recording_url","fontSize":11,"x":1145,"y":1986,"width":340,"height":268,"color":"#f0d9b5"},
		{"id":"3dd058b6","type":"text","text":"5️⃣ Build Transcript\nbuild_transcript(history)\n  → JSON array:\n  [{bot: \"Hi, I'm...\"},\n   {user: \"Hello\"},\n   {bot: \"How can I help?\"}]\n  Filters out system msgs","fontSize":11,"x":810,"y":2120,"width":290,"height":198,"color":"#f0d9b5"},
		{"id":"483ec840","type":"text","text":"6️⃣ LLM Analysis\nOnly if Completed + transcript:\nanalyze_call(transcript, stages)\n  → summary (1 paragraph)\n  → process_id / new_stage_id\n  → next_call_on (IST datetime)\n  → appointment_date_time\n  → doctor / hospital_location\n  → sentiment_score 0.0-1.0","fontSize":11,"x":470,"y":2120,"width":320,"height":238,"color":"#f0d9b5"},
		{"id":"1867f8a0","type":"text","text":"7️⃣ Save to PostgreSQL\nsave_call_log_to_db(\n  call_id, call_log,\n  status, recording_url)\n→ call_logs table\n→ ON CONFLICT upsert","fontSize":11,"x":80,"y":2120,"width":320,"height":175,"color":"#f0d9b5"},
		{"id":"bcd95563","type":"text","text":"8️⃣ Webhook to MantraAssist\nsend_to_backend(payload)\n  POST /v1/webhooks/n8n\n  HMAC-SHA256 signed\n  Headers: x-timestamp,\n    x-timestamp-iso, x-signature\n  Payload: {event: CALL_DATA_UPDATE,\n    data: {summary, transcript,\n           recording_url, duration,\n           next_call_on, process_id,\n           new_stage_id}}\n  Up to 3 retries (1s/2s/4s)","fontSize":11,"x":40,"y":2413,"width":460,"height":310,"color":"#f0d9b5"},
		{"id":"ac1bcf85","type":"text","text":"9️⃣ TOS Telemetry\nreport_telemetry()\n  POST /telemetry/{id}/log\n  \"call_complete —\n   status=Completed,\n   duration=45s\"","fontSize":11,"x":520,"y":2413,"width":290,"height":175,"color":"#f0d9b5"},
		{"id":"3803f8b4","type":"text","text":"🔟 Crash Email\nOn unhandled exceptions:\nsend_crash_email(\n  service=Livekit Agent,\n  error=e,\n  context={room, job, pid}\n)","fontSize":11,"x":865,"y":2373,"width":350,"height":215,"color":"#f0d9b5"},
		{"id":"32a4fee8","type":"text","text":"Room Cleanup\nforce_disconnect_room()\n  lk_api.delete_room()\n  → removes from LiveKit\n  → frees Redis capacity\n  Fallback: ctx.room.disconnect()","fontSize":11,"x":955,"y":2660,"width":500,"height":230,"color":"#f0d9b5"},
		{"id":"4dd56b10","type":"text","text":"LiveKit schedules agent\nto room call_{id}\nAgent worker process spawned\n(num_idle_processes=20)","fontSize":11,"x":40,"y":475,"width":220,"height":70,"color":"#0f3460"},
		{"id":"850a7f45","type":"text","text":"🚀 Step 4: Agent Dispatch\nlk_client.agent_dispatch\n.create_dispatch(\n  room=call_{id},\n  agent_name=mantra-agent,\n  metadata=json(payload)\n)","fontSize":11,"x":40,"y":558,"width":250,"height":220,"color":"#dcedc1"},
		{"id":"0e8ae36c","type":"text","text":"SIP Trunk dials customer\nWait until answered\n(ringing → pickup)","fontSize":11,"x":330,"y":475,"width":280,"height":105,"color":"#ffd3b6"},
		{"id":"f88db68f","type":"text","text":"📞 Step 5: SIP Call (background task)\nsip_client.sip.create_sip_participant(\n  sip_trunk_id=trunk_id,\n  sip_call_to=phone_number,\n  room_name=call_{id},\n  wait_until_answered=True,\n  play_ringtone=False\n)\n→ Uses plivo_client if Plivo,\n  lk_client otherwise","fontSize":11,"x":330,"y":600,"width":380,"height":275,"color":"#ffd3b6"},
		{"id":"5bb4b4aa","type":"text","text":"⬅️ HTTP 200 Response\n{\n  status: success,\n  room: call_12345,\n  token: jwt...,\n  url: wss://mantra...\n}","fontSize":11,"x":800,"y":668,"width":360,"height":205,"color":"#45b7d1"},
		{"id":"90d09283","type":"text","text":"🪪 Monitor Token generated\nJWT with room_join+can_subscribe\nfor dashboard listeners","fontSize":11,"x":785,"y":475,"width":280,"height":160,"color":"#dcedc1"},
		{"id":"55167d9f","type":"text","text":"❌ SIP Failure Handling\nIf create_sip_participant fails:\n1. Detect error type (408=timeout,\n   486=busy, 603=decline)\n2. Store sip_error_status:{id}\n   in Redis (TTL 300s)\n3. Delete room via LiveKit API\n   → triggers agent cleanup","fontSize":11,"x":1180,"y":445,"width":360,"height":270,"color":"#ff6b6b"},
		{"id":"0e6360c8","type":"text","text":"⏰ Stamp call_initiated_at\ninto metadata for post-call\ntiming calculations","fontSize":11,"x":1320,"y":-110,"width":220,"height":190,"color":"#a8e6cf"}
	],
	"edges":[]
}